# SPA fallback.
#
# Prerendered HTML now exists on disk for every real route (/game/<slug>,
# /privacy, /terms, /cookies, /about, and /), and Cloudflare Pages serves a
# matching static asset in preference to these rules. They are only a safety
# net so a hard refresh still boots the app if a prerendered file is missing.
#
# The previous rule was "/* /index.html 200", which made every unknown path
# return HTTP 200 with the SPA shell — including /ads.txt and
# /site.webmanifest, which is an automatic ad-network validation failure.
# Scoping the fallback to real route prefixes lets missing URLs 404 correctly.
/game/*   /index.html  200
/privacy  /index.html  200
/terms    /index.html  200
/cookies  /index.html  200
/about    /index.html  200
